+### 3. Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=remvze%2Fmoodist)
+
+Wasmer detects the Astro site, runs `pnpm install` and `pnpm run build`, and serves the generated `dist` folder as static files. The button imports and builds this public repository as-is; it does not fork it. To customize the site and redeploy on every push, fork this repository and import your own repository on Wasmer.
